      "text": "ADMIN_ExpenseManagement_v1.1.0\n\nDomain:\nAdministration\n\nLifecycle:\nActive / Requirement Refinement / UAT Preparation\n\nProgress:\n~90% (2026-09-15 meeting recap)\n\nGate:\nMulti-traveler request model, end-to-end lifecycle and UAT preparation\n\nOutcome:\nStandardize Administration business-travel and expense-management workflows: Request -> Approval -> Business Trip -> Advance -> Expense -> Settlement.\n\nTop Blocker:\nScope creep beyond Request -> Approval -> Trip -> Expense -> Settlement\n\nNext Milestone:\nValidate the booking workflow and status model\n\nLast Verified:\n2026-09-18",
